": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "But yes", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T19:43:35Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Considered the first Indians", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T19:43:56Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "The people of the Andaman islands I mean ‎", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T19:49:48Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Really fun set @⁨~bijal bhatt⁩ !! Thanks!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T19:50:05Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "I thought genetic evidence says most Indian populations have a non-zero share of genes shared with AASI people who lived along the coast around 50.000 years ago… people go to Andaman after they settled the Indian coast", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T19:50:45Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Yes but these people have the closest link to the first Indians is what I meant", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T19:50:49Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "I didn't phrase it properly", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T19:51:19Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "In the sense that, due to genetic drift, they retained a lot of those genetics", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T19:51:30Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "yes they have the highest share of AASI genetic heritage because of their isolation for tens of thousands of years", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T19:52:28Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Yeah coz they stayed there on their own", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T19:53:17Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Unlike the rest of the subcontinent, which has admixture from all the other 4 major genetic groups (Iranian pre-Neolithic pastoralists, Steppe pastoralists, Austroasiatic people, and Sino-Tibetan people) to varying levels ‎", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]